🗳️ E-Voting System

This E-Voting System designed to make the voting process simple, secure, and efficient.
This project allows registered users to cast their votes digitally and ensures fair counting with transparency.



📌 Features

🔐 User Authentication – Only registered voters can log in and vote.
🗳️ Vote Casting – Users can cast their votes for their preferred candidates.
📊 Real-Time Results – Votes are counted instantly and results are displayed.
⚡ Easy to Use – Simple and user-friendly interface.
🔒 Secure – Prevents multiple voting and ensures privacy.



🛠️ Technologies Used

* Frontend: HTML, CSS
* Backend: Django
* Database: MySQL


